# Estimate editor → Activity History

**Scope:** only Estimate editor files (see globs). `alwaysApply: false`.

When planning or implementing a **user-visible mutation** on the estimate editor, ask in chat **before wiring History** - standard planning/implementation prompt, wait for reply, do not auto-implement.

Skip the question when: read-only UI, cosmetic-only changes, the task already specifies History, or the user already decided.

## Chat prompt (keep it simple)

Adapt labels to the feature being built. Example shape:

> **Historia** - co logować dla [feature]?
>
> **A)** Tylko przy tworzeniu [encji / głównej akcji]  
> **B)** Tworzenie, edycja i usuwanie - **rekomendowane** dla większości zakładek  
> **C)** Inne - opisz zakres (np. tylko eksport, bez edycji)
>
> **D)** Nie logować w Historii

Pick **one recommended option** (usually **B** when the feature has multiple mutations users care about; **A** when only the first/create moment matters; **D** when noise outweighs value).

Do not dump action keys, metadata schemas, or i18n paths in the prompt - handle those after the user chooses.

## After the user confirms

Implement per `docs/features/estimate-activity-history.md`:

- `logEstimateActivity()` from orchestration layer (`service.ts`, `*-actions.ts`, Trigger) - not repositories
- Minimal metadata; no bodies or field-level diffs
- EN + PL under `editor.history.actions.*`
- `router.refresh()` in the client panel when History should update without navigation

Reference: `docs/features/estimate-activity-history.md`
